  "description": "A typesafe F# DSL for building and reading Word documents (.docx/.dotm), interpreted into calls against the DocumentFormat.OpenXml SDK. Unlike write-only Word generators, this round-trips and can decompile an existing file into equivalent, runnable F# source (Document.generateScript), plain XML against a real embedded schema (Xml.ofDocument/Xml.toDocument, Xml.xsd), or plain JSON (Json.ofDocument/Json.toDocument) - read a real document, get back the code or data that rebuilds it. Covers paragraphs and runs (rich, independently-styled text), named styles, numbered/bulleted lists, tables, images, hyperlinks, bookmarks, comments, sections and page setup, headers/footers, document protection, and VBA macro embedding.",
  "id": "Kookerella.FsWordDsl",
